WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.215
The flashes weren't inside the storm.

2
00:00:02.615 --> 00:00:03.658
They were above it.

3
00:00:04.208 --> 00:00:06.031
Pilots reported them for decades.

4
00:00:06.481 --> 00:00:07.528
Few believed them.

5
00:00:08.028 --> 00:00:10.152
Then. in 1989.

6
00:00:10.422 --> 00:00:12.686
a camera test in Minnesota
caught one.

7
00:00:13.286 --> 00:00:14.240
By accident.

8
00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.574
These strange flashes
are called sprites.

9
00:00:18.074 --> 00:00:21.188
They can appear nearly eighty
kilometres above Earth.

10
00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:23.213
vanishing in milliseconds.

11
00:00:23.713 --> 00:00:26.229
Then cameras in orbit
captured them. too.

12
00:00:27.029 --> 00:00:28.156
The pilots were right.

